      "writtenOn": "2021-02-05T15:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is mostly that the devicetree uses compatible strings to indicate the device driver. It is true that when there is only one device of a particular type actually present, then you could use the path. But it is better to follow the convention where possible.",
